    "controller_support": "full",
    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This is a mini puzzle game for cooperative puzzle-solving abilities that may test the emotional strength of the relationship between friends/partners, requiring you to trust, accept, and even tolerate each other. With simple controls (three buttons) and a loud voice, you can make the Balloon Friends UP and DOWN, exactly like your emotions.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Simple operation:</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Just control the movement of your balloon to the left and right, and absorb the gas from your teammate to make yourself rise!</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Simple mechanism:</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You'll play in puzzle levels with different mechanisms and functions. Solve them and get to the end! Come and Start your tacit challenge! All that you need is to bring your <i>Booming Voice</i> along with your dear him/her(/it?). But please don't fight with each other, or at least try to be gentle.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Not-so-simple teammate</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >However, remember this: Dealing with the puzzles might not get you through the levels; dealing with your teammate might will.</p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This is a mini puzzle game for cooperative puzzle-solving abilities that may test the emotional strength of the relationship between friends/partners, requiring you to trust, accept, and even tolerate each other. With simple controls (three buttons) and a loud voice, you can make the Balloon Friends UP and DOWN, exactly like your emotions.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Simple operation:</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Just control the movement of your balloon to the left and right, and absorb the gas from your teammate to make yourself rise!</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Simple mechanism:</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You'll play in puzzle levels with different mechanisms and functions. Solve them and get to the end! Come and Start your tacit challenge! All that you need is to bring your <i>Booming Voice</i> along with your dear him/her(/it?). But please don't fight with each other, or at least try to be gentle.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Not-so-simple teammate</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >However, remember this: Dealing with the puzzles might not get you through the levels; dealing with your teammate might will.</p>",
    "short_description": "This is a mini puzzle game of cooperative puzzle-solving abilities that may test the emotional strength of the relationship between friends/partners, which requires you and your teammate to cooperate and let the Balloon Friends find the way to the end by conducting the gas!",
